    "text": "You Can Now Stay in a Treehouse Near Starved Rock, and They’re Gorgeous\nBy Sweet Lenny,\n10 hours agoStarved Rock Is Great, but Staying Overnight Just Got Better. While a trip to Starved Rock is awesome, it's usually an in-and-out type of deal unless you're sleeping in a tent. For me, that's not happening, but after hearing about this option, I'm starting to think it's definitely in the cards for an overnight or two.",
